PE 796: A Grand Shuffle / 大洗牌

=== Problem Summary ===
10 decks × 54 cards = 540 total cards
Categories to collect:
  - 4 suits (each appears on 10×13 = 130 cards)
  - 13 ranks (each appears on 10×4 = 40 cards)
  - 10 deck designs (each appears on 54 cards)
Total: 27 categories

=== Simplified cases (single deck, 54 cards) ===
Single deck, 13 cards per suit:
  E[collect 1 suit] = (54+1)/(13+1) = 3.92857
  E[collect all 4 suits] (approx, with replacement) = 8.65385

=== Known result for single deck (coupon collector) ===
For a single 54-card deck, collecting all 13 ranks:
  E ≈ 29.05361725 (given in problem)

PE answer: 43.20649061
  ≈ 43.20649061 (expected draws for 10 decks, all categories)
